Package: ttf-mscorefonts-installer
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Depends: whiptail, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fonts-liberation
Provides: msttcorefonts
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: installer for Microsoft TrueType core fonts (local version)
 This package installs Microsoft TrueType fonts from a local copy
 sourced from Windows 11. No internet connection required.
 .
 Includes the original Web Core Fonts plus modern Windows 11 fonts:
   Segoe UI Variable (default Windows 11 UI font)
   Segoe UI (classic UI font)
   Segoe UI Emoji (color emoji)
   Arial, Arial Black
   Consolas, Courier New
   Comic Sans MS, Georgia, Impact
   Times New Roman, Trebuchet MS, Verdana
   Webdings, Andale Mono
 .
 Fontconfig rules are installed to map:
   sans-serif -> Segoe UI, Arial
   serif -> Times New Roman
   monospace -> Consolas, Courier New
   system-ui -> Segoe UI
   emoji -> Segoe UI Emoji (with fallback for all families)
 .
 NOTE: the package fonts-liberation contains free variants of the Times,
 Arial and Courier fonts. It's better to use those instead unless you
 specifically need one of the other fonts from this package.

